{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06568","headline":"田家杂兴八首 四 · 储光羲","name":"田家杂兴八首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家趋壠亩，当昼掩虚关。\n邻里无烟火，儿童共幽闲。\n桔槔悬空圃，鸡犬满桑间。\n时来农事隙，采药游名山。\n但言所采多，不念路险艰。\n人生如蜉蝣，一往不可攀。\n君看西王母，千载美容颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}